<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">
<span class="c6">Emblems of Triumph for Unholy Death Knight DPS Phase 3</span></h3>Tier is the obvious winner for most spots, both the heroic version, as well as the normal 25 version. I'd strongly recommend using your badges and trophy's on getting four set as fast as possible combined with heroic tier items. It's not really worth it to purchase the 232 versions of this tier unless you're in normal mode ulduar gear or tier, as the heroic 252 off pieces are still slightly better. Chances are you won't need the hit rating on the ring here, but if you've had bad luck with the ring from Yogg-Saron it can be worth the pickup. Unfortunately most of the rest of the badge gear is just not worth your time compared to tier. <br/>
<br/>The sigil is the largest dps increase for badges for any single item, and is a totally viable first purchase option, but is less dps than completing your 4set. My recommendation is to buy the tier pieces you need for 4set, and then buy sigil. <br/>
